<footer class="footer">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-site px-4 sm:px-6 py-10">
    <p class="display" style="font-size:2rem; color:var(--yellow)">{{ site.name }}</p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="max-width:62ch">
      One HTML file, generated by a Python build — Jinja2 templates, content as Python
      data, and a Pillow image pipeline. No CDN, no runtime dependencies, no build
      artefacts in the browser. Loud on the outside, tested on the inside.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-5 text-sm" style="max-width:62ch">
      Maximalism is the house style. Nine devices are quoted from other design eras and
      labelled where they appear:
      {% for era, year, where, what in borrowed %}{{ era }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-5 text-sm">
      © <span id="year">{{ year }}</span> ·
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email</a> ·
      <a href="{{ site.github }}" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> ·
      <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
